## Bitmask DP

### Tutorial

	- **10.5 - DP on Bits, 19.2 - Hamiltonian Paths** (CPH) — Elevator Rides, SOS, Hamiltonian
	- [A Primer on Bitmask DP](https://nwatx.me/post/dpbitmasks) (nwatx) —
		example - similar to Hamiltonian
