It seems that when multiplication / division is involved in this problem,
$n^2 < \texttt{LLONG\_MAX}$.

```cpp
ll inv_general(ll a, ll b) {
	array<ll, 3> x = extend_euclid(a, b);
	assert(x[2] == 1);  // gcd must be 1
	return x[0] + (x[0] < 0) * b;
}
